====================

Repository root NOTICE. Prepared 2026-10-23; staged 2026-10-24 on branch
staging/0.4-mit-licence-and-logo, based on commit
53711d496bd7cc6c6b7dfac308f8ba345d4a1df4 (tree
9bc2d0868a754068d5c59fee95a7b502d47d0a80, 2,540 tracked files). Nothing is applied to
